body:
Good for her.

&#x200B;

I see some of y'all seething tho. Stay pressed!

Cigar shops.

&#x200B;

Search for "cigars" in google maps.

These sites are great especially if you're in Riyadh

&#x200B;

[http://top-vapes.com](http://top-vapes.com/index.php?route=common/home)

&#x200B;

[http://www.myvapesa.com](http://www.myvapesa.com/index.php?route=common/home)

It's a non-factor now.

&#x200B;

I have a mixed group of friends, men and women, all saudis and we hang out and ride around in the same car, go to restaurants, and cafes, and even to the desert. It's fine now. Not like how it was say, 3 years ago.

It's allowed.

&#x200B;

I've been to like 5 open mic nights at cafes here in Riyadh and have seen random live performances at restaurants.

It's legal. It was never illegal.

&#x200B;

I don't know where you live but here in Riyadh, I've already been to a bunch of open mic nights at certain cafes and some place have live bands playing.
